Please review the updated event and user details below:

Event Details:
- Event Title: <%= @event.title %>
- URL: <%= @event.url %>
- Status: <%= @event.event_status.humanize %>

User Details:
- Username: <%= @event.user.username %>
- Email: <%= @event.user.email %>
- Role: <%= @event.user.role&.title || ‘Unknown’ %>
- Last Sign-In IP: <%= @event.user.last_sign_in_ip %>
